            "review_title": "Review at Lumos Restaurant",
            "review_text": "188petere\nBrisbane, Australia1758 contributions\n0\nThere for a tour organised lunch but not impressed\nSep 2019\nProbably the blandest food we have had in Vietnam.\n\nOn a private tour we were shown to 4th floor dining area which had no view, no ambience, poor to average service& uninspriring plan tasting & boring food.\n\nLots of staff but loud, disinterested & not great service.\n\nFood was a bland 'pumpkin soup with maybe hint of ginger', a plain cucumber, lettuce & tomato salad, a spring roll, some plain rice noodle with a chicken dish, steamed rice & a steamed cabbage & desert of watermelon. Not sure it was even Vietnamese.\n\nDrinks fairly priced - beer & softdrink but coffee dear.\n\nUnsure if ground floor is beeter but wont ge back to try.\nRead more\nService\nFood\nWritten September 14, 2019",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-15",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
