            "review_title": "Review at Lumos Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Lgerc1\nBrisbane, Australia101 contributions\n0\nTry the Thai Seafood Hotpot - to die for!\nJan 2019 • Couples\nOn both visits to this restaurant we had the excellent Thai seafood hotpot for around 500VND at around 20 USD - pricey by Vietnam standards but excellent quality and packed with seafood cooked and served at the table by an attentive waiter. We were in Hanoi in Winter and the spicy soup was just the winter warmer required after a long morning shopping in the old quarter. Highly recommended.\nRead more\nWritten January 10, 2019",
            "rating": 5.0,
